UR  - http://sfx.mpg.de/sfx_local?sid=OVID:psycdb&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.3389%2Ffneur.2024.1283140&issn=1664-2295&isbn=&volume=15&issue=&spage=1283140&pages=&date=2024&title=Frontiers+in+Neurology&atitle=Variability+of+large+timescale+functional+networks+in+patients+with+disorders+of+consciousness.&aulast=Gong&pid=%3Cauthor%3EGong%2C+Anjuan%3BWang%2C+Qijun%3BGuo%2C+Qian%3BYang%2C+Ying%3BChen%2C+Xuewei%3BHu%2C+Xiaohua%3BZhang%2C+Ying%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2024-60482-001%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EJournal+Article%3C%2FDT%3E
