T1  - Dissociation between neurovegetative signs and subjective symptoms in a case of idiopathic pilomotor seizures.
T3  - Neuropsychiatry, Neuropsychology, & Behavioral Neurology
A1  - Puligheddu, Monica
A1  - Bortolato, Marco
