N2  - Compared the alpha-index and spatial synchronization of brain biopotentials under functional loads addressed predominantly to one or the other hemisphere. 2,049 right-handed 6-55 yr olds were divided into 3 groups: (1) Ss with functional right hemisphere dominance, (2) Ss with functional left hemisphere dominance, and (3) Ss with an equilibrium of hemispheric functioning. There were no definite interrelations between the alpha-index and spatial synchronization. The most pronounced decrease of the alpha-index occurred during the arithmetic task performance in Ss with functional right hemisphere dominance. (PsycInfo Database Record (c) 2023 APA, all rights reserved)
